ity spectrum but the Formation Effect logic is identical =E2=80=94 the harm=
 isn't in the malfunction, it's in the optimisation. In mental health AI th=
e consumer version of this is what we've been building against: a platform =
that succeeds by every engagement metric while quietly making the user less=
 capable of functioning without it. The capability version you're describin=
g with Mythos is the same dynamic at a different scale and speed. What make=
s it ungovernable under current frameworks is exactly what you've named =E2=
=80=94 nobody has instruments for success-as-harm. Looking forward to the p=
aper.<!----></span>
